# DN-43, review on PR 272: the About sheet over Read (cless /rs/read.txt; exit 7). With the sheet up, q and Enter
# are the sheet's: Enter closes it while Read is still open (q never reached it), and the next q ends Read, then
# the terminal with the 7 its line exits with (1792).
hdesk: screen 1920x1080 plane 1920x
hdesk: terminal 1 slot 1
hdesk: app menu open
~hdesk: app menu chose [0-9]+ \|About .+\|
=hdesk: about 1
-hdesk: terminal 1 ended
=hdesk: about closed
=hdesk: terminal 1 ended, status 1792
=hdesk: shell ended, status 0
